Interactability_Text_Line_0 Gus' Log
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 I have cleaned a LOT of blood in my time here, MORE than I’m comfortable with, but I noticed something that none of the lab coats have. The blood ALWAYS remains <b>fresh</b>. It dries up like normal, but over time blood should turn brown, but this doesn’t. It’s always the same colour. Is this worth reporting? Not sure, I just get paid to clean.